; word-gender-derivation-fourway.fk — a second, third and fourth pair of eyes on the
; parts of the moon-gender derivation that can cross.
;
; The walkers read a self-contained source and have no `import`, so this cell composes
; each recipe the way the walkers need it — reads the derivation, appends one call,
; writes it — and then host-execs the three siblings on it. No bash.
;
; Five crossings on all four kernels — 11111, 11111, 11111, 111111, 11111111:
;
;   shape     the composition computes the gender; the composition is read over the
;             referent (Mädchen acks neuter over a girl); three names disagree
;   standing  the two readings of `das Mädchen` put to one row set — the standing
;             reading mispredicts two rows of four, the shape reading mispredicts none
;   venus     one language, one body, two everyday names, two genders (die Venus /
;             der Morgenstern) — the theorem without a cross-language step
;   typology  cognition/gender-typology-trace.fk — the root trace across families: which
;             cultures carry a gender system, which carry none, what each sorts at its
;             root, and the English within-lineage control
;   pronoun   cognition/pronoun-attestation-trace.fk — when each culture's pronouns first
;             entered the record, written and spoken, and what the earliest ones sorted
;
; Verdict digits, low to high: shape, standing, venus, typology, pronoun.
; 0 = all five FOUR-WAY.
; Each digit is fr-diagnose's own: 0 FOUR-WAY / 1 FKWU-SUSPECT / 2 WALKER-SUSPECT.
;
; What does not cross, named exactly: `nothing` is an unbound identifier in all three
; walkers (go, rust, ts alike), so every digit of the nine-digit `word-gender-check`
; that rests on axiom-1's third state stays native-only. That is a hole in the proof
; organ, not in this cell: no cell that honours nothing as first-class can currently
; reach a second pair of eyes. Named here as the next stone; see
; receipts/2026-07-28-the-moon-was-never-masculine.md.
;
; preludes: form/form-stdlib/four-way-run.fk form/form-stdlib/form-fs.fk
; witnessed: 2026-07-28 -> 0 (all five FOUR-WAY)
import "../word-gender-derivation.fk"
import "../gender-typology-trace.fk"
import "../pronoun-attestation-trace.fk"
(do
    (defn wgf-cross (src path call fkwu-v)
        (do (write_file path
                (str_concat (read_file src)
                            (str_concat "\n(" (str_concat call ")\n"))))
            (fr-diagnose
                (str_concat "./walkers/go/walker " path)
                (str_concat "./walkers/rust/target/release/form-walker-rust " path)
                (str_concat "node --experimental-strip-types walkers/ts/main.ts " path)
                fkwu-v)))
    (let derivation "cognition/word-gender-derivation.fk")
    (add (add (add (add
        (wgf-cross derivation "/tmp/wg-shape-recipe.fk" "word-gender-shape-check"
                   (word-gender-shape-check))
        (mul 10 (wgf-cross derivation "/tmp/wg-standing-recipe.fk" "word-gender-standing-check"
                   (word-gender-standing-check))))
        (mul 100 (wgf-cross derivation "/tmp/wg-venus-recipe.fk" "word-gender-venus-check"
                   (word-gender-venus-check))))
        (mul 1000 (wgf-cross "cognition/gender-typology-trace.fk" "/tmp/wg-typology-recipe.fk"
                   "gender-typology-check" (gender-typology-check))))
        (mul 10000 (wgf-cross "cognition/pronoun-attestation-trace.fk" "/tmp/wg-pronoun-recipe.fk"
                   "pronoun-attestation-check" (pronoun-attestation-check)))))
